  "headline": "KPK Summons Family Of Former BNPB Chief In Disaster Fund Inquiry",
  "seoTitle": "KPK Summons Former BNPB Chief Suharyanto Family In Case",
  "metaDescription": "The Corruption Eradication Commission has summoned the wife and child of former BNPB Chief Suharyanto to testify regarding ongoing disaster fund probes.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Corruption Eradication Commission summoned the wife and child of former BNPB head Suharyanto as witnesses.",
    "The investigation centers on alleged corruption involving the management of emergency disaster funds.",
    "Authorities are also examining the procurement processes and vendor selection practices used within the agency."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Corruption Eradication Commission (KPK) is actively investigating allegations of corruption regarding the administration and distribution of 'Dana Siap Pakai' (DSP), or ready-to-use funds, allocated for disaster management within the National Disaster Management Agency (BNPB). Recent investigative efforts have included questioning agency officials, such as the Chief Secretary, regarding mechanisms for the direct appointment of private vendors and the allocation of disaster relief budgets to external parties. As part of this ongoing inquiry, investigators have now issued summons for the wife and child of former BNPB chief Suharyanto to appear as witnesses. These developments are part of a broader scrutiny into financial oversight at the agency, following various audits and investigations by the KPK into public fund mismanagement within multiple Indonesian government institutions.",
